(text "Motor VM and servo power do not pass through this carrier. Use separate rated wiring and supply." (at 15 241.5 0) (effects (font (size 0.97 0.97)) (justify left)) (uuid "813ee389-d5dc-500e-9c26-557b2a272e34"))
(text "A maintained hardware emergency-stop must interrupt motor/servo power independently of firmware." (at 15 245.5 0) (effects (font (size 0.97 0.97)) (justify left)) (uuid "bbc2986e-8561-55c3-9992-9e45d6b8b025"))
(text "J21 uses a normally closed auxiliary contact: healthy = low, emergency/disconnected = high." (at 15 249.5 0) (effects (font (size 0.97 0.97)) (justify left)) (uuid "ea3cc2a8-5e8b-5555-b0d1-0703c2a6a271"))
(text "J22 uses a normally open lid switch: fully closed = low; open or disconnected = high." (at 15 253.5 0) (effects (font (size 0.97 0.97)) (justify left)) (uuid "6a395014-6419-5245-bc12-2d4069690156"))
(text "J19: select pin 3 (inverted open-drain) OR pin 4 (direct 3.3V). Never short the two outputs; no bare buzzer." (at 15 257.5 0) (effects (font (size 0.97 0.97)) (justify left)) (uuid "315e4c8e-628f-5b25-836b-94c462b0e60d"))
(text "J10: 5V PWM signal via U6; SG90 power external. Core removed from training board; verify wires before power." (at 15 261.5 0) (effects (font (size 0.97 0.97)) (justify left)) (uuid "bd0388d0-a1a7-5e4d-82bb-f38efa00b1b0")))